    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ellie used to think that winter was a bad time to travel. This journey proved her wrong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 colored Japanese crossword puzzles of all difficulty levels, a pleasant autumn story, and charming music will help you pass the time and have a ton of fun! Puzzles are a great opportunity to challenge yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels, solve puzzles, and help Ellie and her friends enjoy scenic winter locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 150 colorful and memorable levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Striking visual effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An exciting adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lush colors reminiscent of winter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Improve your logical and abstract thinking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- User-friendly interface and addictive gameplay!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ellie used to think that winter was a bad time to travel. This journey proved her wrong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 colored Japanese crossword puzzles of all difficulty levels, a pleasant autumn story, and charming music will help you pass the time and have a ton of fun! Puzzles are a great opportunity to challenge yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels, solve puzzles, and help Ellie and her friends enjoy scenic winter locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 150 colorful and memorable levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Striking visual effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An exciting adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lush colors reminiscent of winter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Improve your logical and abstract thinking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- User-friendly interface and addictive gameplay!</p>",
    "short_description": "Enjoy a winter fairy tale with Ellie! Learn more about the nature in the winter! Piece your adventure together! 150 exciting levels for players of all ages!",
